        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda siguura Abiya bea ng'eanyiida Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gweaydeaba damasis bea sugoocheanda was Yeroboamu was orjeeda Nebati, ghang'eat Abiya ak goombali ng'eanyiida Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goombaliischi gweanyeew samwagu aba Yerusalemu. Nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Maaka was hudeaba Abishalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwaneayeewa jeeda riing'eega ghayi sin ghwaan nea gurooroadaanyi ea mii hidaat muuchi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI, mawuurji guroorooda Dawdeeda was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba badayda Dawdi ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANYI gheaboong'nyeanda aba Yerusalemu, gaygagatkat orjeedaanyi jea gawa hoorgeadaanyi, ak ghwadeas Yerusalemu; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba Dawdi gwasin ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea mii ghwanung'waada gida wassean sirukusa niny galeaga sean aba jeeda eaweagaaschi, geaghus badayda Uriyaheeda eemeeda Hiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanda ng'ucheeda dageascheeda Rehoboamu ea Yeroboamu aba jeeda eawoojigaaschi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gadiyoojiga siipuut bea Abiya, ea gilinyoo gwasin sean, meeng'oorsiina jeeda Gitaabooda Damanyoojiga bea Sugoodiga Yuda? Hean goobiida ng'ucheeda dageascheeda Abiya ea Yeroboamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaluudayi Abiya ghweanigaaschi; hean geebung'sa jeeda mujiineeda haw bea Dawdi. Ak goombaliischi orjeedaanyi siguura Asa gawa hoorgeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda siguura Asa bea ng'eanyiida Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba diktam bea Yeroboamu was sugoocheanda Israeli ghang'eat Asa ak goombali ng'eanyiida Yuda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goombaliischi gweanyeew haradam ea agi aba Yerusalemu. Gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Maaka was huda Abishalomu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Asa gwasin ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, gawuurji gida ghayi sin Dawdeeda was ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gooruuta buuneeda sean hiseada aba jeeda ng'eanyiida, ak gwajakta aseecheeka sisna geatinga ghayi sin ghweanigaaschi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageandeawa Maakaheeda was ghaamwat hoorgeeda gatmooda sugoocheanda, aba gideaba gwasin aseecheeka was Ashera was munyinda. Ghwalach Asa aseecheekaaschi ak gagwardeaysa murdeeda eenda Gidroni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea heeda siikghaambiit ea meegeanda. Nea aba huumwa guroorooda Asa ea doabiiwaat aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba eawoojigaaschi sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gweadu jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA haleanjeeda ghayi badiischeesa ghwaan ea gea badiischeesa niny, was lapiya, ea dahaabu, ea dabita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwanda ng'ucheeda dageascheeda Asa ea Baashaheeda was sugoocheanda eawoojiga nyaawa sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baashaheeda was sugoocheanda Israeli gawa ng'eanyiida Yuda, ak ghwadeas mujiineeda Rama, ea mudu gwanda siichea gwarita ghana ghwahidu heeda Asaheeda was sugoocheanda Yuda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gageanu Asa lapiyeeda sean ea dahaabu ghayi siipuut aba heeda siitiiwiisa haleanjeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA ea gea gheeda sugoocheanda, ak ghwayiin geatinga fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda. Ak Asaheeda was sugoocheanda goojeakta saawa heeda Ben-hadadi was orjeeda Dabrimoni bea orjeeda Hesioni, sugoocheanda Shaamu, abeeda abiita ng'eanyiida Dameski, ak gwayeesha, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gagasa gwanda neajeeda bugusteanya aniini ea ang'iing'i, gawuurji gidaghayi sin bwaabwa ea gweanu. Ng'ula neayeaneey gidageatinda was lapiya ea dahaabu; ng'eada una nyarja neajeedeang'wa sea Baashaheeda was sugoocheanda ng'eanyiida Israeli, ak abeeda gajiidu ghang'amwanaan.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gooleeysiit Ben-hadadi sugoocheanda siguura Asa, ak goojeakta shirikarajeega hees bea lugooda gaweay jeeda mujiinajeega hees bea Israeli ak ghaghas Iyoni, ea Dani, ea Abel-bet-maaka, ea Gineroteeda sean, ea ng'eanyiida sean bea Naftali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghwayiiy Baasha ng'asheanji, ghwanung'waada deesta Rama, hean goobiida Dirsa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadayda sugoocheanda was Asa iita heeda fuga sean bea Yuda, nea adiidu geesiksa eara siyagi, ng'ata gageanda lagheanga Rama ea geedigaaschi, ghayi deakta Baasha; ak ghwadeasa sugoocheanda was Asa mujiinajeega Geba bea Benjamini ea Mispa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghamneawa gadiyoojiga siipuut bea Asa, ea uurdaanyi, ea gilinyoo gwasin sean, ea mujiinajeega hees ghayi sin, meeng'oorsiina jeeda gitaabooda damanyoojiga bea sugoodiga Yuda? Damanda gwearguumeadaanyi ghang'ut geeyooda geeshanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaluudayi Asa ghweanigaaschi, aba ng'ata geebunyuudayi ghweanigaaschi aba mujiineeda haw bea Dawdeeda was ghwaan: ak goombaliischeewa orjeedaanyi was Yehoshafati hoorgeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda siguura Nadabu bea ng'eanyiida Shumwaheeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghang'eat Nadabeeda was orjeeda Yeroboamu goombali fuga Israeli gweaydeaba iyeenya bea sugoocheanduumeeda Asa bea ng'eanyiida Yuda; ak hean ghoahaaghwa fuga Israeli aba gweanyeew iyeenya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin munyinda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, nea ghwaat geeshta ghwaan, aba ramaseandaanyi ak ghwanung' ghwaramwasta fuga Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak Baashaheeda was orjeeda Ahiya, bea gheeda Isakari, gwasissa foolayda; ak ghabwar ghami Baasha aba Gibetoni, bea ng'eanyiida Filisti; aba gideaba Nadabu ea eemeeda sean bea Israeli gagasa ghaghas Gibetoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baasha gwanuus niny aba gweaydeaba samwagu bea Asaheeda was sugoocheanda fuga Yuda, ak goombaliischi aba hoorgeadaanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda was sugoocheanda, ghabwar goosha fuga sean bea gheeda Yeroboamu; manda siida nung'wa jeeda gheeda Yeroboamu nea gwandeawa eaweega, bwak ea gahuuyda sean, gawuurji gidanyaashta ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA gidaghayi baloolda aba ghuuta siidaanyi bea gadiyeeda was Ahiya bea eemeeda Shilo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nea nih gweagu riing'eeda Yeroboamu ghayi sin ak ghwanung' gwasin riing'eeda fuga Israeli, ea gidanung' ghwanyareas NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hean gadiyoojiga huuydeanda bea Nadabu, ea gilinyoo gwasin, meeng'oorsiina jeeda gitaabooda Damanyoojiga sugoodiga Israeli? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 15:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghang'eat ng'ucheeda aba bugusta Asa ea Baashaheeda was sugoocheanda Israeli aba jeeda eawoojiga nyaawa sean.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.15.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.15.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Sugoocheanda siguura Baasha bea ng'eanyiida Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
