          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin munyinda aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwaat geeshta Yeroboamu ea riing'eadaanyi nung' gwasin fuga Israeli riing'eeda.",
          "type": "text",
